[2026-05-10] [Public Launch] — Decision: Hybrid persona model (user-configured with preset shortcuts). Rejected: generic/stripped AI only. Because: the app's value comes from personalized AI voice; presets lower the onboarding bar without sacrificing quality.
[2026-05-10] [Public Launch] — Decision: Free tier (1 sort/week) + BYOK (unlimited, user's own key). Rejected: fully hosted paid-only, fully free. Because: BYOK removes cost risk for power users; free tier lets newbies experience the value before committing.
[2026-05-10] [Public Launch] — Decision: No Stripe/payments in v1. Rejected: build billing before launch. Because: validate with real users before building payment infrastructure; ship fast and learn.
[2026-05-10] [Public Launch] — Decision: Supabase for user data (personas, encrypted BYOK keys, usage tracking). Rejected: session/cookie-only storage. Because: cookies can't enforce server-side rate limits and don't persist across devices.
[2026-05-10] [Public Launch] — Decision: Owner email bypass via env var preserves Dr. K clinic context unchanged. Rejected: migrating clinic context into the persona system. Because: existing behavior must not regress for Katelyn while multi-user is being built.
